WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:04.700
The next morning, a lady got on the bus.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:10.600
And when she got on the bus, the bus driver comes up, took the lady off and tried to arrest her.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.460
When the police got there, he arrested the lady.

4
00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:19.920
But then somebody came from police headquarters and said “You ain’t got no business arresting this lady.”

5
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.800
And he told the policeman, “You go back to headquarters.

6
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:26.507
I’ll handle this.” . . . So the bus company, they got mad and went on a strike.
